eth rogen and evan  goldberg the same team that's partly  behind amazon to the boys  and stars dominic cooper and ruth nega  and if you're not already sold critics  call this visually stunning adaptation  a thrilling celebration of the bazaar  you can binge  all four seasons in about 43 hours and  it'll be even more fun if you invite  your ex and a hard drinking irish  vampire  to join you and for our brand new pick  this week we've hunted down  amazon's hunters which debuted in  february from executive producer jordan  peel this drama follows a ragtag team of  nazi hunters in 1977 new york city  critics say that the stylish first  season is propelled by a strong cast  that includes al pacino  logan lerman and jerica hinton and an  even stronger sense of justice  no word yet on a second season for  hunters but you can binge the first one  in about 10 hours complete with all the  glorious 70s cars and fashion that you  can handle  and finally our certified fresh pick  this week is legion  this sci-fi drama from fx ran for three  straight certified fresh seasons  and is about a diagnosed schizophrenic  played by dan stevens who discovers  special powers that change his life  forever  the cast also includes watchmen's gene  smart who just picked up an emmy  nomination for supporting actress  and critics call legion a singular piece  of visually arresting mind-bending  television that never fails to surprise  you can binge all three seasons in  around 27 hours and keep an ear out for  the heavy influence of pink floyd used  by show creator  noah holly all right friends hopefully  this will make you a very happy watch  person for your next few bench sessions  be sure to let us know what you are  currently streaming in the comments  and don't forget to hit that subscribe  button and notification bell so you  don't miss out on any future  recommendations based around the movies  and shows that you love  right here on the rotten tomatoes binge  guide thank you so much for watching  this video  and we'll see you guys next time bye  you
 

